{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And their heritage perished from Heshbon.</b> That is to say, the heritage and possession of theirs — Heshbon perished, and all the land up to Dibon, that they would not inherit it with its inheritance. 'Heritage' [ניר] is in the language of 'inherit,' as in: ״ולמען היות ניר לדוד עבדי״."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:53.464272131Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}